        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mumwaka mutaanzi wabwami bwa-Koresi mwami wa-Persia, kuti lizuzigwe ijwi lya-Jehova ndyaakaamba kumulomo wa-Jeremiya, Jehova wakabusya moyo wa-Koresi mwami wa-Persia, nkabela wakatuma impuwo mubwami bwakwe boonse, alimwi wakalemba mbubonya, wati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
