                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nguni akati kanu uuli wabantu bakwe? Leza wakwe abe awe. Anyamuke kuya ku-Jerusalemu mucisi ca-Juda, ayake iŋanda ya-Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli. Ngonguwt Leza uukede mu-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumbwa uusyaala mumasena oonse nkwaakali kukala-kala, bantu babusena bwakwe bamugwasye insiliva angolida ambono aŋombe azipo zyamoyo zyakugwasya iŋanda ya-Leza yaku-Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
